2026-10-28  Steve
  * Version 0.1.0-alpha.1
  * Initial alpha release of Phantom Power.
  * Added PhantomPowerSensor with linear dimmer and fan speed scaling.
  * Added configurable device registry linking (link_device).
  * Added PhantomEnergySensor with continuous Riemann sum power-to-kWh integration and persistent state restoration.
  * Added PhantomPowerGroupSensor for multi-entity wattage summation and diagnostics.
  * Added YAML configuration loader with hot-reload service (phantom_power.reload).
  * Added reset service (phantom_power.reset_energy).
  * Added DEFAULT_POWER import to cfg.py.
  * Added multi-state and attribute rule matching (states) on power sensors with case-insensitive value and contains operators.
  * Added realistic power variance jitter (variance) to synthesize natural electrical fluctuations.
  * Added climate and vacuum entity discovery to config flow and visual editor.
  * Added interactive state rule builder to Phantom Power Editor.
  * Added visual web editor in phantom-power-editor/ with automatic entity discovery, one-click power/energy generation, group management, and Home Assistant webhook synchronization.
  * Updated project license to GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 (LGPL-3.0).
  * Added Google App Engine deployment configuration (app.yaml) and configured hosted editor URL as default in const.py.
  * Added webhook integration to custom_components/phantom_power.
  * Added install script, HACS metadata, example configurations, and release notes.
